url | url_type | region | source | channel_id | video_count | playlist_count | format_type | lang_flag | confidence | evidence | discovery_path | status | notes
# Pipe-delimited (Arabic titles contain commas). The discovery agent emits rows with status=pending;
# you flip rows to `approved`, then: python scripts/acquire_channels.py --registry <this file> --root "D:\Research\DID_Set\libyan"
# region in {Tripolitania, Cyrenaica, Fezzan, Mixed, Non-Libyan, Unknown}; lang_flag in {arabic, code-switch:<lang>, minority:<lang>}.
# video_count = videos on the channel; playlist_count = shows (playlists). Backfill both with scripts/enrich_candidates.py.
# A multi-region channel: set status=expand, then scripts/expand_channels.py splits it into per-show playlist rows.
